Kodio Web 0.2.0 sample-rate compatibility patch

Upstream: https://github.com/dosier/kodio
Published sources: https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/space/kodio/core-wasm-js/0.2.0/core-wasm-js-0.2.0-sources.jar
License: Apache License 2.0, https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

This build verifies the official source archive and changes one expression in
WebAudioRecordingSession.prepareRecording: missing or nonpositive track sample
rates use the requested recording format instead of constructing AudioContext
with zero. All other upstream sources are unchanged. Android retains its
published artifact; the separate JVM build retains its Java 21 compatibility.
Remove this patch when the upstream browser recording session handles these
track settings. Real Firefox synthetic capture and persisted WAV tests cover it.
